{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04150","headline":"送特进李峤入都祔庙 · 徐彦伯","name":"送特进李峤入都祔庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"特进三公下，台臣百揆先。\n孝图开寝石，祠主卜牲筵。\n恩级青纶赐，徂装紫橐悬。\n绸缪金鼎席，宴饯玉潢川。\n北斗分征路，东山起赠篇。\n乐池歌绿藻，梁苑藉红荃。\n骑转商岩日，旌摇关塞烟。\n庙堂须鲠议，锦节伫来旋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}